#: ../../source/notebooks/17. 45ea3e05b9f24b62ae30a56b8eefc1be Models.ipynb:9
#: Multi-Symbol
msgid "Multi-Symbol Models"
msgstr "多品种模型"

#: ../../source/notebooks/17. 921886505fff406dbcc5f5e5a82d68f5 Models.ipynb:11
#: Multi-Symbol
msgid ""
"The models trained so far have trained a separate instance for every "
"ticker symbol. Symbols that share the same dynamics, such as stocks in a "
"single industry, can instead be modeled jointly. This approach provides a"
" single model with much more data to learn from."
msgstr "到目前为止，我们训练的模型都是为每个股票代码单独训练一个实例。而对于具有相同动态特征的品种（例如同一行业的股票），则可以将其联合建模。这种方法能让单个模型获得更多可供学习的数据。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/17. 7ad99df2205c486ba3e26c688ea37c59 Models.ipynb:13
#: Multi-Symbol
msgid ""
"**PyBroker v2** supports training one model across all symbols passed to "
"`add_execution "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution>`__,"
" as shown in this notebook."
msgstr ""
"**PyBroker v2** 支持在传递给 `add_execution "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution>`__"
" 的所有品种上训练同一个模型，本文档将对此进行演示。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/17. 7a0892ba9c1b4771bc3fb96625dfda60 Models.ipynb:64
#: Multi-Symbol
msgid "Training One Model on Multiple Symbols"
msgstr "在多个品种上训练一个模型"

#: ../../source/notebooks/17. 3086b55bd4d74cf38d4bf10bcce7b7a2 Models.ipynb:66
#: Multi-Symbol
msgid ""
"This notebook repurposes the linear regression example from `Training a "
"Model "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/6.%20Training%20a%20Model.html>`__."
" Below, one shared `LinearRegression <https://scikit-"
"learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.linear_model.LinearRegression.html>`__"
" model is trained with the `close_minus_ma "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.indicator.html#pybroker.indicator.close_minus_ma>`__"
" indicator on four chip stocks:"
msgstr ""
"本文档复用了 `训练模型 "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/6.%20Training%20a%20Model.html>`__"
" 中的线性回归示例。下面将使用 `close_minus_ma "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.indicator.html#pybroker.indicator.close_minus_ma>`__"
" 指标，在四只芯片股上训练一个共享的 `LinearRegression <https://scikit-"
"learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.linear_model.LinearRegression.html>`__"
" 模型："

#: ../../source/notebooks/17. 2eadbd34ef334d65ab309b7c57a30cfd Models.ipynb:104
#: Multi-Symbol
msgid ""
"Registering the model with ``pooled=True`` via `model "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.model.html#pybroker.model.model>`__"
" trains it only once per execution. When you enable this, the training "
"function replaces its single ``symbol`` argument with a tuple ``symbols``"
" and receives their combined train and test splits."
msgstr ""
"通过 `model "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.model.html#pybroker.model.model>`__"
" 以 ``pooled=True`` 注册模型后，该模型在每次执行中只会训练一次。启用此选项后，训练函数会用一个 ``symbols`` "
"元组替换原本单一的 ``symbol`` 参数，并接收这些品种合并后的训练集和测试集划分。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/17. 40157ac35a2b4d68b3131e30ffb99adf Models.ipynb:106
#: Multi-Symbol
msgid "During the backtest, the trained model is shared across symbols:"
msgstr "在回测过程中，已训练的模型会在各品种之间共享："

